    "content": "<p>These are the patch notes for the War Robots: Frontiers build available from March 9, 2023. Update your game to the latest version and start playing in Early Access!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>BALANCE CHANGES</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Reduced the detonation delay of the Sharp Feathers ability projectiles on Raven.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>BUGS FIXED</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Fixed an issue that prevented players from auto-spawning their Titans following the destruction of their remaining Robots.</li>\r\n\t<li>Fixed an issue that prevented Fowler weapons from dealing damage at large distances.</li>\r\n</ul>",
